  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QuzWr5u8RrU?embeds_referring_euri=https\" height=\"536\" width=\"750\"></iframe></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fQzjZ48bNSK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_6e1aaa07-b0df-4b6b-8d20-208954b0942b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhybrid-aquatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_c5ce3b6b-b781-45f5-8ee1-77746bcf41f1.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/HybridLabs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_99d4a8cb-c47a-483f-9d4b-02985d2110c0.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>什麼是 Hybrid Aquatic？</strong></h2>\n<p>Hybrid Aquatic 是一款增強您 Minecraft 水下體驗的模組！探索改進後的河流、沼澤、海洋和海底洞穴，體驗全新的生物、方塊和生態系。</p>\n<p>我們致力於捕捉現實生活中海洋生態系統的美麗與神秘。準備好迎接一個在驚險的海底冒險中平衡驚人奇觀的世界吧。</p>\n<p>Hybrid Aquatic 融合了創意與寫實。潛入水中，探索新領域，揭開深藍色的秘密。準備好在水下世界留下您的足跡，並遇到前所未有的奇觀吧！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>功能特色</strong></h2>\n<p>Hybrid Aquatic 添加了大量海洋生物，包括新魚類、鯊魚、甲殼類動物、小生物、水獺、鸚鵡螺、新的迷你 Boss 等！</p>\n<p>該模組還添加了各種物品和方塊，例如潛水裝備、海綿、釣鉤、貨箱、海葵以及新型珊瑚！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>依賴項</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>Forge:</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Kotlin For Forge</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithostitched\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithostitched</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biolith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Biolith</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Curios API</strong></a></p>\n</div>\n<h3><strong>Fabric:</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric Language Kotlin</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithostitched\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithostitched</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biolith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Biolith</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Trinkets</strong></a></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>常見問題</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>問</strong>：您是否會更新到 [在此插入版本]？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>：尚未決定，但希望會。</p>\n<p><strong>問</strong>：您是否會將此模組向後移植到 [在此插入版本]？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>：1.20.1 之前的版本不會進行向後移植。</p>\n<p><strong>問</strong>：是否計劃與 [在此插入模組] 兼容？</p>\n<p><strong>答</strong>：我們的任務包括盡可能多地添加與其他模組的兼容性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>其他 Hybrid Labs 模組</strong></h2>\n<p>這些是我們製作的其他項目，與 Hybrid Aquatic 完美整合！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-delights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_7e2f41ee-114d-46dd-83bc-94d678bf3535.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-birds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_2b94decf-ab97-42aa-8202-47f8c34a2c49.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/834427/description_5a98dc74-9cdf-405a-bdf5-89194e3480e2.png\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fHybridLabs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/10829140-dddf-40b7-9a07-f9299910862e.png\"></a></p>",
